  m_Name: Carta_Ciclovias
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Ciclovias
  _titleEn: Bike Lanes
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Ciclovias protegidas tornam a bicicleta segura para o dia a dia, um
    transporte barato, sem emiss\xE3o e bom para a sa\xFAde."
  _summaryEn: Protected bike lanes make cycling safe for daily trips, a cheap, emission-free
    and healthy way to travel.
  _realWorld: "Bogot\xE1 fecha ruas para carros aos domingos desde 1974 na Ciclov\xEDa,
    que re\xFAne centenas de milhares de pessoas, e construiu uma grande rede de
    ciclorrotas."
  _realWorldEn: "Bogot\xE1 has closed streets to cars on Sundays since 1974 for its
    Ciclov\xEDa, which draws hundreds of thousands of people, and built a large network
    of bike routes."
  _tradeOffs: "Ciclovias tiram espa\xE7o de carros e vagas, o que gera resist\xEAncia,
    e trechos soltos sem rede cont\xEDnua s\xE3o pouco usados."
  _tradeOffsEn: Bike lanes take space from cars and parking, which draws resistance,
    and disconnected stretches without a continuous network see little use.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Ciclov\xEDa (Wikipedia)"
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ciclov%C3%ADa
